ÑPerilepse
Mia sunarpastike nautike peripeteia pou katalegei s' enan kruptographiko gripho, ena taxidi sta bathe tes anthropines psukhes, mia teletourgia diabases pros to anosio: mes' apo phourtouniasmenes thalasses, antarsies, nauagia, kanibalismous kai xotika nesia me epikindunous katoikous, enas idiophues suggrapheas odegei ton anagnoste tou se mia kathodo sto asuneideto, se mia pale tou leukou me to mauro, e kai se mia lazarike anastase, aphou o nekros eroas, pou einai zontanos, diekdikei apo ton suggraphea ten patroteta tou ergou.
To proto pezographema tou Edgar Allan Poe, to "semantikotero ergo tou" kata ton Borges, pou eperease plethos gnoston suggrapheon.
Periekhomena
Prologiko semeioma sten ellenike ekdose (tou metaphraste) || Eisagoge (tou Harold Beaver) || Semeioma gia to keimeno (tou Harold Beaver) || Protoselido tes ekdoses Harper (1838) || Prologos (tou Entgkar 'Alan Poe) || E Aphegese tou 'Arthour Gkornton Pim apo to Nantaket || Semeiose (sten prote ekdose) || Epimetro tou Harold Beaver || Parartema"à
ÖLiving in their car, surviving on tips, Charmaine and Stan are in a desperate state. So, when they see an advertisement for Consilience, a 'social experiment' offering stable jobs and a home of their own, they sign up immediately. All they have to do in return for suburban paradise is give up their freedom every second month - swapping their home for a prison cell. At first, all is well. But then, unknown to each other, Stan and Charmaine develop passionate obsessions with their 'Alternates,' the couple that occupy their house when they are in prison. Soon the pressures of conformity, mistrust, guilt and sexual desire begin to take over."à
ÖTo Sanset Park aphegeitai tis elpides kai tous phobous mias omadas axekhaston eroon ste diarkeia tes amerikanikes oikonomikes katarreuses tou 2008. Tesseris apentaroi eikosaredes kanoun katalepse s' ena egkataleleimmeno spiti sto Sanset Park, mia agria geitonia tou Mprouklin. O Mpingk Neithan, o epikephales tes omadas, einai enas pelorios tupos, pou paizei ntrams kai perna te mera tou sto Nosokomeio Spasmenon Antikeimenon epidiorthonontas keimelia pou kataskeuastekan otan oi pappoudes tou etan paidia. E Elen einai mia melagkholike kallitekhnida pou katalambanetai apo erotika oramata. E Alis mia phoitetria pou prospathei na oloklerosei te diatribe tes kai o Mails enas phugas. Katarrakomenos apo tis enokhes tou gia ton thanato tou eterothalous adelphou tou, o Mails ekhei diakopsei kathe epikoinonia toso me ton patera tou kai te metria tou oso kai me te metera tou. Gia ena diastema eikhe kataphugei ste Phlorinta, opou ergazotan se sunergeio katharismou kataskhemenon spition apo te saboura pou aphenan piso tous oi idioktetes tous mes sten apognose kai ten orge tous. O Mails epistrephei ste Nea Uorke otan e erotike tou skhese me mia koubanoamerikana pitsirika mpainei se epikindune trokhia. E metakomise aute tha ekhei aprobleptes sunepeies toso gia ton idio oso kai gia tous sugkatoikous tou...
To Sanset Park diadramatizetai stis EPA tes oikonomikes krises, tes khreokopias ton noikokurion kai ton kataskheseon spition. Mia istoria gia to pos mporei kaneis na epistrepsei se enan kosmo pou ekhei aphesei oristika piso tou kai pos ginetai na xanasmixei me tous anthropous bgainontas apo ten exoria kai ten apomonose tis opoies eikhe o idios epilexei. O Auster apodeiknuetai gia alle mia phora euphues stilistas tou logou, graphontas ena exokho, diakhutiko kai pathiasmeno muthistorema, me skholastika doulemene dome, gia te sugkhrone Amerike kai ta phantasmata tes.
Opos sumbainei sunethos me to magiko kai aiphnidiastiko osteriko stil graphes, kathe stoikheio tou muthistorematos einai potismeno me upainigmous, e istoria tou kathe eroa photizei tis tragikes mas adunamies kai te bathutate anagke mas gia epaphe, sundese kai omorphia. Se mia epokhe apokardiotikes krises kai ragdaion allagon, o Auster mas thumizei ti ekhei pragmatika axia: e agape, e tekhne kai to thaumasto paradoxo tes zoes."ä
áO plethusmos tes Ges ekhei apodekatistei apo kapoia ergasteriaka kataskeuasmene pandemia. Ekhoun epibiosei mono mia mikre omada anthropon kai oi Kreikanthropoi me ta prasina matia -kalokagatha anthropoeide pou demiourgese o Kreik gia n' antikatastesei tous anthropous. E Tompi, kapote melos ton Kepouron tou Theou kai eidike sta manitaria kai stis melisses, einai eroteumene me ton Zemp, o opoios ekhei endiapheron parelthon. Mazi me ton prophete ton paidion tou Kreik, ton Khionanthropo-ton-Tzimi, ten Amanta, ton Druokolapte, ten Ponere Alepou kai tous upoloipous Phrikoplastous, idiophueis bio-epistemones, paleuoun na epibiosoun kai na sothoun ap' ten epithese ton mokhtheron Ponosphairiston kai ton organokhoiron, diagenetikon gourounion me anthropina organa.
Me pneumatode diathese, asteireute phantasia kai skoteino khioumor, e brabeumene me Booker Margkaret Atgount mas paradidei to aproblepto, tromaktiko, alla tautokhrona xekardistiko To Telos tou Kosmou -ton sugkinetiko kai dramatiko epilogo tes emblematikes trilogias."å
âFrom the author of the bestselling Gould's Book of Fish, The Sound of One Hand Clapping and The Unknown Terrorist comes a haunting meditation on love, loss and the way life is finally determined never by reason, but only ever by wanting.
In 19th-century Van Diemen's Land, a young Aboriginal girl, Mathinna, is adopted by the celebrated explorer Sir John Franklin and his wife, Lady Jane, to show that the savage can be civilized. Lady Jane believes the distance between savagery and civilization is the learned capacity to control wanting. The experiment fails, and Sir John disappears into the blue ice of the Arctic, seeking the Northwest Passage. A decade later, Lady Jane enlists Charles Dickens' aid to put an end to the scandalous suggestions that Sir John's expedition ended in cannibalism.
Wanting
confirms Richard Flanagan's growing reputation as one of our most original and powerful novelists."å

â
Ta dodeka diegemata tou Mpris Nt' Tz. Pankeik apotuponoun aristotekhnika to aphiloxeno phusiko periballon kai tis antixootetes tes zoes ste geneteira tou, te Dutike Birtzinia. Oi eroes tou einai agrotes, anthrakorukhoi, xepesmenoi pugmakhoi, neoi pou asphuktioun sten upaithro, anthropoi egklobismenoi pou xespoun se praxeis tuphles bias. O melagkholikos kosmos tou apodidetai me lite kai kophte glossa, pou sukhna dianthizetai me lurismo kai sarkastiko khioumor.
"O Pankeik gennetheke to 1952 kai autoktonese to 1979, se elikia eikosi epta eton. E autoktonia tou anekopse proora mia suggraphike poreia pou anamenotan lampre. Ostoso, kai mono ta dodeka diegemata pou prolabe na oloklerosei kai perilambanontai sto ana kheiras biblio arkoun oste semera na theoreitai "enas apo tous pente kaluterous diegematographous ton teleutaion penenta eton" (Guardian)
"O kaluteros, o pio authentikos suggrapheas pou diabasa pote." (Kurt Vonnegut)
"Enas exairetika talantoukhos nearos suggrapheas, pou mpainei kaneis ston peirasmo na sugkrinei to ntempouto tou me to ntempouto tou Khemingouei." (Joyce Carol Oates)
"E graphe tou Pankeik einai monadike: trakhia, dektike, boutegmene sten ome pragmatikoteta. Einai mia graphe asthmainousa, pou menei kharagmene sto mualo tou anagnoste." (Margaret Atwood)"é
ãTo monadiko muthistorema tou Stephan Tsbaikh perigraphei sparaktika te basanistike prodosia tes times kai tou erota, me phonto te dialuse tes Austroouggrikes Autokratorias. To muthistorema, grammeno tis paramones kai upo te skia tou eperkhomenou Deuterou Pagkosmiou polemou, topotheteitai stis paramones tou Protou Pagkosmiou polemou kai teleionei me te sphaira pou skotose ton arkhidouka Phragkisko Pherdinando tes Austrias sto Saragebo.
Oi eroes einai oi aposbolomenoi theates tes tragodias tous, sumbola enos parakmiakou politismou pou den mporei omos na antistathei ste diegertike khara enos teleutaiou bals. E proza tou Tsbaikh, uperokhe kai ekleptusmene, moiazei me ta leipsana autou tou politismou pou ton katapie e trela tou 20ou aiona. O oiktos parousiazetai os ena epikinduno sunaisthema. Mia emiparalute gunaika katastrephetai apo ton polu oikto tou periballontos tes - tou patera, tou giatrou tes kai tou arraboniastikou tes.
To pio sunarpastiko biblio pou ekho diabasei... ena puretiko, goeteutiko muthistorema.
- ANTHONY BEEVOR, NEW YORK REVIEW OF BOOKS, 2007
O Tsbaikh etan ena skoteinos kai anorthodoxos kallitekhnes. Me ton Epikinduno oikto ton kalosorizoume xana me megale khara.
- SALMAN RUSHDIE, 2011
Ena mageutiko anagnosma, pou tha klonisei tis ethikes paradokhes sas gia to ti sunista euthune tou atomou, kai mia ousiastike upenthumise gia tis dunatotetes tes kales logotekhnias.
- ALI SMITH, BEST BOOKS OF THE YEAR, THE GUARDIAN, 2011
To muthistorema tou Tsbaikh mas metapherei sten epokhe pou e Europe epephte ste dine tou khaous, xekinontas apo ten elleipse leptotetas enos axiomatikou tou ippikou se ena paliomoditiko saloni kai kleinontas me te sphaira pou skotose ton arkhidouka Phragkisko Pherdinando... O Tsbaikh uphainei mia suntaraktike aphegese gia to ti ginetai otan o oiktos esphalmena theoreitai pos einai erotas kai parousiazei me euphue tropo tis katastrophikes sunepeies pou antimetopizei opoios xupna to pathos se prosopo anepithumeto.
- ALFRED HICKLING, THE GUARDIAN, 2011
Mia sunthete, kathelotike, tromaktika alethine alla katholou ethikologike spoude ston sunaisthematiko ekbiasmo, stis diabrotikes, akome kai psukhophthores sunepeies tou oiktou kai ste diapistose oti <>.
- THE FINANCIAL TIMES, 2011
Ena polu dunato muthistorema... Auto pou entuposiazei kurios einai e ikanoteta tou Tsbaikh na mas kanei na niosoume tis biaies sunaisthematikes metastrophes olon ton prosopon tou ergou san na etan dikes mas. Mono enas suggrapheas me megale euaisthesia tha mporouse na to petukhei auto.
- ANTHONY DANIELS, THE SUNDAY TELEGRAPH"è
åTo patoma etan marmarino kai oi toikhoi etan diakosmemenoi me gupsina anaglupha ta opoia e egkataleipse eikhe phrontisei na ta kanei agnorista. Kati kinetheke anamesa sta agriokhorta. Mporei na etan arouraios. Tora omos ole mou e prosokhe eikhe sugkentrothei se mia diplophulle porta. Apo ekei ebgaine e mousike kai epises enas pagomenos aeras pou xaphnika stegnose ton idrota sto prosopo mou. Mesa ekei, photismene apo tesseris proboleis pou kremontan se kati terastia dokaria, mia kopela ekane patinaz s'ena pagodromio...
E Z, mia mikre touristike pole stis aktes tes Katalonias, to kalokairi, o kausonas, prosopa sugkinetika kai asteia, adunatoi erotes, katakhreseis kondulion, katapontismenes politikes philodoxies, ereipia pou stegazoun mustika, kai treis ekdokhes enos egklematos: idou to skeniko pou stenei o Romperto Mpolanio gia auto to paraligo astunomiko muthistorema, pou photizetai apo to melagkholiko kai sklero khioumor tou.
Tria prosopa pairnoun to logo san na ekhoume treis diadokhikous rolous: enas apogoeteumenos Khilianos suggrapheas, enas Mexikanos poietes khoris adeia paramones, nukhtophulakas se kampingk, kai enas demotikos upallelos etoimos na ta kanei ola gia te gunaika pou agapa. Miloun gia tous erotes tous, gia tis autapates pou trephoun, gia to diaphoretiko tous pepromeno, pou to ekhei magnetisei, se olous anexairetos, o thanatos.
To Pagodromio ekhei ola ta diakritika tou logotekhnikou sumpantos tou Romperto Mpolanio: tis diaplekomenes phones pou anaggelloun katopines poluphonies, ton kodika tou astunomikou muthistorematos, tous katestrammenous erotes, tis khamenes autapates. Epises, ten ikanoteta tou suggraphea na paraterei ten pragmatikoteta kai na ten ermeneuei me idiaitero tropo. Briskoume kai edo ton aphegematiko palmo tou e to aneleeto khioumor tou, pou aikhmalotizoun ton anagnoste apo ten prote selida, idiotetes pou ekhoun katastesei ta erga tou muthistoremata anaphoras sten epokhe mas. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)
"O Mpolanio estiazei ston diko tou idiaitero kosmo, sten apogumnomene ki omorphe poiese tou" (Revista de Libros)
"O Mpolanio einai o Mpolanio... pantote. Den se apogoeteuei pote" (La Voz de Galicia)"ë
éPoios etan o Alexios Komnenos pou tha polemouse se Anatole kai Duse gia na sosei to Buzantio apo to kheilos tou gkremou; Poies gunaikes ton agapesan; Poios prospathouse na ton deleteriasei; Giati e thugatera tou, e Anna Komnene, misouse ton aderpho tes, to sunautokratora Ioanne; Giati e gunaika tou, e Eirene Douka, proothouse to Nikephoro Bruennio sto throno; Anthropoi kai gegonota, apotukhies, dakrua kai kaemoi, elpides, oramata pou esbesan, khares pou exanemistekan, mikrotetes kai pathe. To muthistorema "Enas skouphos apo porphura" philodoxei na zontanepsei ten teleutaia analampe tou Buzantiou kai na mas taxidepsei s' ekeina ta duskola khronia, mesa apo ten aphegese enos asemou palatianou, pou aposurmenos ste Sinope tou Pontou, xanathumatai, empleos deous, ta perasmena."ë

é
To "Peri bibliothekon" einai mia bibliophilike kai paigniodes anthologia keimenon gia bibliothekes - demosies e idiotikes. Arkhizontas me te bibliotheke tou "Nautilou" tou ploiarkhou Nemo ston Ioulio Bern kai te bibliotheke tou "Megalou Anatolikou" ston Andrea Empeiriko, prokhorame sten atermone bibliotheke, metaphora tou sumpantos, tou Borges. O Umberto Eco skholiazei ten idanike sugkhrone bibliotheke. O Perec paizei me ten taxinomese ton biblion ki o Jacques Roubaud me tis strategikes pou anaptussei e bibliotheke gia na men paradosei ta potheta biblia stous anagnostes. Sten Dorothy Sayers e bibliotheke ginetai topos organoses phonou. E bibliotheke enos bibliophilou, tou Walter Benjamin, xanastenetai otan bgainoun ta biblia apo tis koutes meta apo duo khronia. Ste mellontike koinonia tou Ray Bradbury, opou apagoreuontai ta biblia, oi anthropoi apostethizoun ta keimena kai ginontai oi idioi biblia kai e koinoteta oloklere mia bibliotheke. Ston RoIde skholiazetai kaustika e dike mas Ethnike Bibliotheke to 1880. O Nerval kati anapherei, to 1850, gia te nea plege ton gallikon bibliothekon, ton "pontiko ton Athenon", pou erthe se koutes me biblia tes Gallikes Skholes tes Athenas. Kai, ste bibliotheke tou theiou Skroutz, aneurisketai o khamenos khartes enos nesiou me thesauro..."ì
êEna pagkosmio best seller gia ten eleutheria, te gennaioteta, ten aphosiose, ta oneira, ten oikogeneia kai pano apo ola ten anagke gia agape.
<>"ò
ïLes quatorze essais regroupes dans ce volume, publies a l'origine dans divers journaux et revues, couvrent une periode allant de 1960 a 1985. James Baldwin y evoque les marches pour les droits civiques, les raisons de son exil en France, ses rencontres avec Martin Luther King, sa critique de l'education aux Etats-Unis ou encore sa celebration de la langue noire. Explorant les tensions et non-dits qui touchent son pays, Baldwin offre une analyse pertinente, severe et subtile de la societe americaine qui n'a rien perdu de son actualite ni de sa necessite. Ces textes dressent le portrait d'un homme dont la perspicacite, l'engagement et l'ecriture ont ouvert la voie a de futurs grands ecrivains noirs americains. <>Toni Morrison - See more at: http://vitrine.edenlivres.fr/publicat..."ò
ïE sulloge "Ta mustika opla" perilambanei tessera exokha deigmata tou anuperbletou aphegematikou talentou tou Khoulio Kortasar kai tes tekhnikes tou na krata kathelomeno ton anagnoste. Anamesa tous kai to pio gnosto tou diegema: "Ta salia tou diabolou", apo to opoio o Mikelantzelo Antonioni daneisteke ten idea gia ten tainia tou Blow Up.
Ekhontas piso tou mia iskhure logotekhnike paradose, kai kurios ton Kh. L. Mporkhes, o Khoulio Kortasar akolouthese me exairetike epitukhia tis dikes tou aisthetikes anazeteseis.
O kosmos pou periballei tous aplous kathemerinous anthropous ton diegematon tou apoteleitai apo ena axedialuto meigma pragmatikotetas kai phantasias, mesa sto opoio oi anthropoi parasurontai san se oneiro. Piso apo te sunethismene zoe tous krubontai antres kai gunaikes pou zoun autoexoristoi stis phantasioseis tous, proskollemenoi se emmones idees, aphemenoi stoika sta kheria tragikon sumptoseon."ô
ñE amerikanida Merilin Rompinson, mia apo tis semantikoteres suggrapheis tes epokhes mas, mas kharizei ten axekhaste istoria enelikioses enos koritsiou pou megalonei sto perithorio tes koinonias mes ston phobo kai to deos, ta khronia tes megales upheses tes amerikanikes oikonomias te dekaetia tou 1920. E Laila, astege kai mone, aphou ekhei periplanethei epi khronia sten upaithro, mpainei sten ekklesia mias mikres poles tes Aioba gia na brei kataphugio apo te brokhe. Aute tha einai e aphorme gia na gennethoun enas erotas kai mia anazetese pou tha tes allaxoun te zoe. Aphou pantreutei ton ierea tes ekklesias kai brethei se asphales kai prostateumeno periballon, tha xekinesei na anazeta to noema ton duskolon khronon tes uparxes tes.
Ena biblio gia ton erota pou erkhetai otan pia se ekhei semadepsei e zoe, ena biblio gia ten piste, alla kai gia ola auta pou den mporoun na ekphrastoun me lexeis, oso bathia ki an ta niothoume.
a brei kataphugio apo te brokhe. Aute tha einai e aphorme gia na gennethoun enas erotas kai mia anazetese pou tha tes allaxoun te zoe. Aphou pantreutei ton ierea tes ekklesias kai brethei se asphales kai prostateumeno periballon, tha xekinesei na anazeta to noema ton duskolon khronon tes uparxes tes.
Ena biblio gia ton erota pou erkhetai otan pia se ekhei semadepsei e zoe, ena biblio gia ten piste, alla kai gia ola auta pou den mporoun na ekphrastoun me lexeis, oso bathia ki an ta niothoume."ù
öKategoroumenos gia katokhe narkotikon kai prophulakismenos sten Mpangkok, o Manouel Manrike, Kolombianos phoitetes philosophias, kinduneuei na katadikastei se thanato, an den paradekhtei sto dikasterio ten enokhe tou. Tha empisteutei ten istoria tou ston proxeno tes Kolombias pou ekhei analabei na kheiristei ten upothese tou, tha tou exomologethei te monakhike zoe tou kai te phuge apo ten abastakhte kathemerinoteta mesa apo te logotekhnia kai ton kinematographo, pou tou apokaluptoun oti uparkhoun ki alloi anthropoi san ki auton, <>.
To mono prosopo pou agapese o Manouel, e adelphe tou Khouana, exaphanisteke prin apo tessera khronia, ki ekeinos, akolouthontas ta ikhne tes, perase apo ten Mpangkok me teliko proorismo to Tokio, opou ekhei mathei oti zei mplegmene se ena kukloma porneias. Osa agnoei o Manouel tha ta aphegethei e adelphe tou, eno o proxenos, sugklonismenos apo ten peripeteia tes zoes tous, einai e trite phone tes aphegeses. <>, delonei o romantikos Manouel, katoikos ton oneiron, pou, opos kai e kunike pragmatistria Khouana, tha sugkroustei me dunameis pio iskhures apo ton idio.
Telika, auto to muthistorema einai kai astunomiko kai istoria agapes pou enonei duo adelphia. Kai politike kataggelia tou kathestotos tes Kolombias, kai poietike proseggise. Me logotekhnikes kai kinematographikes anaphores, me diadromes anamesa sten Mpogkota, to Delkhi, ten Mpangkok, to Tokio kai ten Tekherane. Milontas gia ten agape, ten odune, ten exegerse, te bia, te monaxia, ton phobo, ten enokhe. Me ena orama os to telos aplesiasto: <>(A. Rempo)."†
ùAute einai e istoria duo orphanon aderphon pou megalonoun se mia mikre pole khamene mes sten aperantosune tes Boreiodutikes Amerikes, opos ten aphegeitai e mia ek ton duo, e Routh, ena melagkholiko kai oneiropolo koritsi, anemporo na pistepsei se kati monimotero apo mia stigme, mia thumese e ena oneiro. Ekhontas biosei ten egkataleipse apo mia seira apo suggeneis, e Routh kai e Lousil katalegoun ste phrontida tes Sulbi, tes apomakres kai ainigmatikes aderphes tes meteras tous kai agonizontai na enelikiothoun semademenes apo ten apoleia kai te monaxia. E poreia tous kathrephtizetai stis uperokhes eikones apo to pagomeno phusiko topio pou tis periballei s' ena sugkhrono muthistorema pou ede apo ten ekdose tou khairetisteke os klasiko.
Mia aristourgematika lurike aphegese me epikentro osous den katapheran na sundethoun pote me enan topo, enan skopo, mia kathemerinoteta e enan allo anthropo. gia osous zoun xekhasmenoi apo ten istoria prospathontas na epheuroun mia zoe khoris opoiadepote sterixe.
Klasiko. San seirena e Rompinson se trabaei ston apatela reusto, uperokha phtiagmeno parallelo kosmo tes. [Guardian]
Niotheis ten kathelotike apeleutherose sussoreumenes suggraphikes autopepoitheses, ten eukhariste ekplexe apenanti stis aprosdoketes dunatotetes tes glossas, mia prosektike alla bathia agape gia tous anthropous pou nomizame pos mono oi agioi mporoun na aisthanthoun. [New York Times ]
Epiasa ton eauto mou na diabazei olo kai pio arga. Den einai biblio pou prepei na diabastei biastika. Kathe protase einai alethine apolause. [Doris Lessing]"£
†Enas antras exaphanizetai musteriodos apo te Phielmpaka. Para tis epimones prospatheies tou Patrik kai ton sunadelphon tou, kaneis den gnorizei an zei e an pethane. Tesseris menes argotera anakaluptoun to ptoma tou, kokalomeno mes ston pago. E upothese peripleketai otan o protoemphanizomenos suggrapheas Kristian Tintel, ton opoio e Erika ekhei boethesei me to biblio tou, arkhizei na lambanei anonuma apeiletika grammata. O Kristian einai sto katophli tes megales epitukhias me to muthistorema tou E gorgona otan lambanei ena akoma menuma ste diarkeia tou parti parousiases tou bibliou tou. O nearos suggrapheas katarreei mprosta sten Erika, kai eno prospathei na upotimesei te semasia tou gegonotos, e Erika analambanei drase[?] pairnei to gramma kai to deikhnei ston Patrik. Edo kai kairo e Erika ekhei katalabei oti kati basanizei ton Kristian kai anesukhei gi' auton, eno o Patrik suneidetopoiei oti o Kristian diatrekhei megalo kinduno - kapoios trephei bathu kai asbesto misos gi' auton kai den tha distasei na kanei tis apeiles tou pragmatikoteta."£
†O Tsaz Gouilmot katekhei arista tis tekhnikes zographikes ton palion megalon daskalon -tou Leonarnto, tou Gkogia, tou Gkeinsmporo-, alla auto to stul den ekhei pia perase. Etsi, phutozoei phtiakhnontas apomimeseis gia diaphemiseis kai exophulla periodikon. Ospou analambanei ten apokatastase mias nopographias tou Tiepolo s' ena benetsianiko palatso kai e ekplektike douleia tou traba ten prosokhe tou Berner Kremps, enos emporou tekhnes me skoteino parelthon kai akome pio upopto paron. Me ten uposterixe tou Kremps, o Gouilmot douleuei pia aperispastos. Oi demiourgikes tou ekrexeis, omos, arkhizoun na sunodeuontai apo allokota dialeimmata: xanazei stigmes apo to parelthon tou -okhi os anamneseis, alla san na sumbainoun pali apo ten arkhe. Kai suntoma, den xanazei kan to diko tou parelthon- taxideuei sto dekato ebdomo aiona, me ten aisthese oti einai o Belasketh ki ekhei demiourgesei ena aristourgema, ena ekplektiko gumno. Ki otan o pinakas emphanizetai pragmatika, o Gouilmot den xerei an ton zographise ekeinos e an phantasteke aute ten istoria."•
¢Ena oloklero sumpan asulleptes ki apateles omorphias apo ton spoudaiotero Iapona muthistoriographo.
E gata tou Torou Okanta exaphanizetai ki auto anastatonei te gunaika tou, pou ginetai olo kai pio apomakre.
Ustera arkhizei mia seira apo musteriode telephonemata. Kai kathos xetuligetai aute e sunarpastike istoria, e aple, metremene kai kapos aniare zoe tou Okanta (o opoios mageireuei, diabazei, akouei tzaz kai opera kai pinei mpira sto trapezi tes kouzinas tou) erkhetai ta pano kato, kai xekinaei ena allokoto taxidi me aphaneis odegous diaphorous paraxenous anthropous, pou o kathenas ekhei na diegethei kai mia istoria.
O Mourakami graphei gia te sugkhrone Iaponia kai to semerino kosmo, gia ten apoxenose stis poleis kai ta taxidia autognosias, kai s auto to biblio, sunduazontas anamneseis apo ton polemo me metaphusikes anesukhies, oneira kai paraistheseis, uphainei ena oloklero sumpan asulleptes ki apateles omorphias."•
¢Ena sugkhrono aristourgeua apo ten pio deuophile Italida suggraphea tes epokhes uas. E "Uperokhe phile uou", to proto biblio tes Tetralogias tes Napoles, einai e istoria tes Elenas kai tes Lilas, uia istoria pou xekina te dekaetia tou '50 ue phonto uia phtokhogeitonia tes Napoles. E suggrapheas kataduetai sten periploke phuse tes philias ton duo koritsion pou apo ephebes ginontai gunaikes, akolouthontas beua beua ten exelixe katheuias xekhorista, ton tropo pou e uia epereazei ten alle, ta sunaistheuata pou ana tis dekaeties tis boethoun na khtisoun uia ousiastike, aklonete skhese. Me aparauillo stil kai apsegadiaste, skholastike uatia e Pherrante se uia kathelotike aphegese xediplonei uesa apo ten istoria uias philias ten istoria uias geitonias, uias poles ki entelei enos ethnous pou bionei kosuoistorikes allages ue to perasua ton dekaetion.
