Ena 10khrono agori analambanei ten euthune tes oikogeneias tou, otan o pateras kai t' adelphia tou stelnontai se stratopeda sugkentroses kata te diarkeia tes germanikes katokhes sten Tsekhoslobakia. Kunegaei kai psareuei kai phrontizei ten akribe tou mana.
San eleuthero pouli, opos ekeino to kheli sto diegema "O megas aletes ton udaton", pou xeglistraei apo ta desma tou gia na kataphugei sten eleutheria tou potamou, etsi ki o mikros Ota Pabel, san enas allos Tom Soger tes Kentrikes Europes trekhei pano-kato se potamia, limnes kai libadia, giati biazetai na megalosei kai na apodrasei apo mia duskole epokhe pou pernouse e Europe kai pou ta semadia deikhnane pos den tha etane ki e teleutaia."∞
≠Augoustos 1943. O Australos kheirourgos Ntorigko Ebans niothei na ton stoikheionei akome, ustera apo duo khronia, e pathiasmene skhese tou me te gunaika tou theiou tou. E zoe tou s' ena iaponiko stratopedo aikhmaloton polemou ston Siderodromo tou Thanatou pou sundeei ten Tailande me te Birmania den einai para enas kathemerinos agonas na prostateusei tous antres tou apo to xulo, ten peina kai te kholera. Mekhri ten emera pou lambanei ena gramma pou tha ton allaxei gia panta.
Ena aristourgematiko muthistorema gia tis polles opseis tou kalou kai tou kakou, tes agapes kai tou thanatou, kathos enas anthropos epibionei kai orimazei, mono kai mono gia na anakalupsei osa ekhei khasei."≤
ØPosa ospria mporei na phaei kapoios -akoma ki ep' apeile Grexit- khoris na riskarei te skhese tou; Pos ginetai to rabani na periekhei ta dodeka auga pou upagoreuei e suntage khoris to teliko apotelesma na murizei san kati pou mas aphese khronous; Mporei mia spanakopita na se glitosei ap' te kholera; Kai ti mporeis na kaneis entos tou plaisiou tou nomou otan mia philesukhe geitonissa pesei thuma lukanthropismou;
Auta kai alla agoniode erotemata apantontai me tropo spartaristo s' ena bibliaraki pou agapetheke kai pakhune me kainouries istories kai pou xemutizei pali me exophullo dia kheiros tou megistou Arka - mia ki o "Ser" Karkharias einai to mono plasma pou e adephagia tou mporei na sugkrithei m' auten tou allotinou eautou tou suggraphea.
Agape olouthe! (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"µ
≤Eno o Markos Mpardas kai o Sephes Sourodes diabazoun Oikonometria - to teleutaio mathema tou ptukhiou - ta phlas mpak pephtoun to ena piso apo to allo kai to paron ginetai xana photeino, me gunaikes, giagiades kai paraxenes geographies. Oi duo philoi tha zesoun ekato phores te zoe tous, opos sumbainei to bradu tes protokhronias, tha sullaboun to noema ton diakopon, tha katanoesoun te skhese paidikes summorias kai politikes strateuses kai tha suzetesoun me upomone to problema tes ikanotetas ton koritsion na theloun panta kati perissotero apo auto pou khreiazontai. To kalokairi tha arkhisei san oiko-nometriko upodeigma kai tha teleiosei se apolute sugkhuse me te gramme tou orizontos."µ
≤To paron biblio apartizetai apo ennea diegemata, sta opoia kuriarkhoun -mona tous e se sunduasmo- autobiographika, muthoplastika kai pseudodokimiaka stoikheia. Koino tous thema einai -sumphona me ta logia tou idiou tou suggraphea- "to paralogo tes uparxes kai e asapheia ton orion metaxu trelas kai logikes". Ta diegemata, grammena me paigniode kai eniote parodiake diathese, akolouthountai apo semeioseis, oi opoies entassontai aphegematika sto keimeno me tropo pou thumizei kapote ton Mporkhes. Ostoso, ta paigniode stoikheia leitourgoun suneideta os antibaro sto uparxiako bathos. Opos semeionei o idios o suggrapheas: "Epeide to thema tou bibliou einai arketa baru e, mallon, dusbastakto, to uphos einai, sukhna, paigniodes, oste na me barunetai e psukhe okhi mono tou anagnoste alla kai tou idiou tou suggraphea"."∏	
µ	Barkelone, 1957. O Ntaniel kai e Mpea, oi eroes tou bibliou "E skia tou anemou", ekhoun pantreutei, ekhoun apoktesei ena gio kai zoun me ton patera tou Ntaniel sto bibliopoleio Sempere & Uioi. O Phermin ergazetai akome mazi tous kai etoimazetai gia to gamo tou me ten Mpernarnta. Phainetai omos oti kati ton apaskholei.
O Ntaniel einai monos tou sto magazi otan ena proi mpainei mesa enas musteriodes antras pou koutsainei. Entopizei ena polutimo biblio pou phulassetai se bitrina, mia monadike eikonographemene ekdose tou Kome tou Monte Kristo. Para to gegonos oti o xenos de phainetai na endiapheretai gia biblia, thelei na agorasei aute ten akribe ekdose. Kai pros megale ekplexe tou Ntaniel, e prote tou kinese einai na grapsei pano sto biblio tis lexeis: "Ston Phermin Romero nte Tores, pou gurise apo tous nekrous kai pou krata to kleidi gia to mellon". Etsi xetuligetai mia istoria prodosias pou sematodotei ten epistrophe enos thanasimou ekhthrou.
To trito biblio ston kuklo ton muthistorematon pou xekinese me te "Skia tou anemou" kai "To paikhnidi tou aggelou" metapherei kai pali ton anagnoste ston kosmo tou Koimeteriou ton Lesmonemenon Biblion kai sto musteriodes bibliopoleio Sempere & Uioi."Ω
∫Akhilleas Kuriakides, Demetres Kalokures, Aloe Sidere, Jules Verne, Emmanouel RoIdes, Andreas Empeirikos, Jorge Luis Borges, Umberto Eco, Dorothy L. Sayers, Walter Benjamin, Ray Bradbury"ø
ºO Astragalos -sten pragmatikoteta "To katagma ston astragalo"- einai to khroniko mias apodrases apo tis gunaikeies phulakes kai mia istoria epibioses. Somatikos kai psukhikos ponos, suntrophikoteta, sunenokhe, sunomotikoteta, erotas, prodosia: ena autobiographiko muthistorema, opou e anamone moiazei me paralerema. To biblio egine muthos ste dekaetia tou '60 - okhi mono gia ten perigraphe mias zoes sto perithorio, alla kai gia te glossa, gia te khare tou uphous. E Almpertin Sarrazen theoretheke o thelukos Zan Zene, apespase exaisies kritikes, apo ton Nouvel Observateur mekhri tis khristianikes ephemerides, kai to 1968 egine eroida kinematographikes tainias me protagonistes te Marlen Zomper kai ton Khorst Mpoukholts. Mia kainouria diaskeue tou bibliou probletheke ton Aprilio tou 2015 me protagonistria te Leila Mpekhti."√
¿O "Allokotos ellenismos" photizei epta ekkentres morphes tes neoellenikes pneumatikes istorias, oi opoies aphosiothekan me pathos stis skheseis ellenismou kai khristianismou, Anatoles kai Duses kai apotolmesan asunethistous peiramatismous me te neoellenike tautoteta. Oi paragnorismenes autes anazeteseis tes ellenikotetas gennethekan ligo prin kai ligo meta ta duo krisima istorika orosema tou ellenismou, ten ptose tou Buzantiou (1453) kai te demiourgia tou neoellenikou kratous (1830), apolegontas se epta ekdokhes oriakes empeirias ton ideon ston eurutero elleniko khoro: periplanese (Kuriakos Agkonites), outopia (Plethon), ektopismos (Maroullos Tarkhaniotes), blasphemia (Khristodoulos Pamplekes), airese (Theophilos KaIres), allokoto (Panagiotes Sophianopoulos), pseudologia (Konstantinos Simonides).
Sunduazontas te melete ton pegon me ten istoria ton ideon kai ton philosophiko stokhasmo, to dokimio tou Niketa Siniosoglou khartographei mia lesmonemene methorio tes neoellenikes istorias ton ideon, ten opoia e kuriarkhe dianoetike istoria antimetopizei me duspistia kai amekhania.
Sten parousa sugkuria akraias politikes reustotetas kai ideologikon anakatataxeon, ta anoikeia akra tes neoellenikes istorias ton ideon apoktoun mian anapantekhe politike semasia.
"Kathe sustema opheleitai anagnorizontas ten anagke parekklises, eno sunama tremei ten uperbole tes. Moiraia e allokote skepse den zei polu. Liges idees katorthonoun na diaphugoun apo te bia tou kanona, ki otan to petukhainoun einai gia ligo mono. To allokoto den dialegetai para semainei. Allokoto einai o,ti antisteketai".
N.S."∆	
√	"Kalos to palikari mou" leei o Ouranos ston Krono pou zugone ap' ten akre tes paralias kratontas kati periergo sto kheri, krummeno ap' ten antelia.
"Geia sou, phader" apanta ekeinos. "Ertha na paixoume raketes".
"Mpalakia de blepo".
"Ki oute tha xanadeis".
Posa xogama eikhe telos panton o Dias; Ti epine e Puthia ki ebgaze tetoious alloprosallous khresmous; Etan ontos dodeka oi athloi tes Eraklaras e mepos o Eurustheas tou 'paixe mpinia sto enenenta; Ki e kopelia e Eileithuia etan st' aletheia toso stokos oso aphenei na ennoethei t' onoma tes e prokeitai gia parexegese kai ten kakologoune tzampa;
S' auta kai s' alla phlegonta erotemata erkhetai n' apantesei e Neoellenike muthologia. Parodontas tous muthous tou Esiodou me tropo paralerematiko kai s' enan diarke dialogo me ten axeperaste Ellenike muthologia tou Tsiphorou, to biblio pou kratate sta kheria sas anaplathei oles tis agapemenes istories ton paidikon mas khronon, photizontas ten ilare pleura tes sunarpastikes peripeteias pou oi arkhaioi Ellenes skarphistekan gia na ermeneusoun ton kosmo. Giati khoris tous theous, tous emitheous kai ta ateleiota kamomata tous e aletheia pou gureuan kai gureuoun akoma oi philosophoi isos kai na 'nai ligo barete."«
ƒO Elias, enas anthropos pou ekhei khasei ta panta -douleia, oikogeneia-, sta penenta tria tou khronia pheugei apo ten Athena kai epistrephei sto khorio tou, to Delbinaki psela sto Pogoni, sta ellenoalbanika sunora. Otan mia neare gunaika brisketai banausa dolophonemene exo apo to khorio, e exikhniase tou phonou ginetai gia ton eroa emmone idea, enas skopos pou gemizei to psukhiko tou keno kai ton adeio khrono.
Me phonto to kheimoniatiko topio tes oreines Epeirou, pou aphenei to apotupoma tou ste lite, adra poietike glossa, sto aperitto uphos tes aphegeses, alla kai sto ethos ton kharakteron, xetuligetai o mitos mias istorias philias kai prodosias pou katalegei ste lutrose me ton erkhomo tes anoixes."Œ
ÀTo biblio xekina me ena seismo, idomeno mesa apo ta matia enos anonumou enniakhronou agoriou pou zei se ena mesoastiko sugkrotema katoikion sto Maipu, tes Khiles. Sto deutero meros, protagonistes einai o suggrapheas tou protou merous tou muthistorematos. O pateras tou einai enas ligomiletos anthropos, o opoios eno iskhurizetai oti den endiapheretai gia ten politike, siopela suntassetai me to kathestos Pinoset.
E aphegese enallassetai anamesa ston suggraphea kai ton protagoniste, to parelthon kai to paron, proballontas me melagkholia kai orge ten istoria enos ethnous, kai mias genias -pou opos leei o suggrapheas emathe na diabazei kai na graphei enoso oi goneis tous eginan sunergoi e thumata tes Diktatorias.
Prokeitai gia to pio prosopiko muthistorema tou Alejandro Zambra (suggraphea tou <>), pou einai isos o semantikoteros Khilianos suggrapheas meta ton Roberto Bolano.
<<...Mia phora, khatheka. Tha 'moun exi e epta khronon. Eikha aphairethei kai, xaphnika, den eblepa pia tous goneis mou. Phobetheka, alla breka amesos to dromo ki ephtasa protos sto spiti - ekeinoi m' epsakhnan sunekheia, apegnosmena, alla ego nomisa oti eikhan khathei* oti ego exera na gurizo spiti ki ekeinoi okhi. <>eipe e metera mou argotera, me ta matia tes akoma klammena. <>skephteka, alla den to eipa...>>graphei o Zambra sto biblio kai o metaphrastes Akhilleas Kuriakides semeionei:
To eipe, argotera, o Alejandro Zambra, graphontas auto to thaumasio muthistorema anapoleses tes paidikes elikias, tes khamenes athootetas kai ton enokhon gia ten apoleia tes athootetas. E ennoia tes apoleias kuriarkhei sten aphegese, ten aphegese tes peripeteias mias aenaes, noeres epistrophes, opou ta psikhoula tou Kontorebuthoule ekhoun phagothei pro pollou..."“
œ"Pos enas suggrapheas, sta khronia tes khountas (sten teleutaia selida delonontai ta khronia suggraphes 1971-74), [...] paraiteitai apo to uliko politikes epikairotetas kai mas dinei ena ergo opou e notha zoe, mazi me ten ephtaetia pou uparkhei san phonto olou tou muthou, phtanei se ena monimo metaphusiko xaphniasma, pos, telos, me auto to uliko kai me aute te methodo egrapse ena biblio pou mas potizei me mia aisthese tes zoes pou den mas egkataleipei aphou teleiosoume ten anagnose, einai kati pou den mporo na perigrapso saphestera giati e monadike empeiria tes anagnoses tou bibliou den ekhei kanena upokatastato".
Mario Vitti, "E Ellada tes Ethnikes Odou. O khronos kai e mneme"
"To Bema", Trite 29 Iouliou 1975"”
–To proto muthistorema tes aisthematikes logotekhnias musteriou (sensation novel), ena ergo pou sunduazei tis sugkineseis tes mesaionikes logotekhnias me ton psukhologiko realismo mias sugkhrones thematographias kai metapherei ton erota alla kai te phrike tou mesaionikou muthistorematos sta salonia mias mesoastikes biktorianes Agglias."‘
—Mia phora ki enan kairo etan o Atzatasatrou Patel, enas Indos ntuuenos sta gkriza, ue autia geuata skoularikia krikous ki ena gigantiaio uoustaki. Phakires sto epaggelua, arketa katergares, diaseuos se olo to Ratzastan gia ten ikanoteta tou na troei kouuatia guali (apo zakhare), na katapinei spathia (ptussouena) kai alla polla... Mia uera o phakires uas autos prosgeiotheke sto aerodrouio Sarl Nte Gkol tou Parisiou, ue proorisuo te Mekka tes sunaruologeses: to katasteua IKEA. Ki auto gia na ananeosei te sanida soterias tou kai sklero ueso bioporisuou tou: ena krebati gia phakiredes, apo authentiko souediko peuko, ue 15.000 karphia, sten exairetike tiue ton 99,99 euro...
To Apisteuto taxidi tou phakire pou pagideuteke se uia ntoulapa IKEA einai uia praguatika apisteute, xekardistike peripeteia ap' akre s' akre tes Europes kai exo apo aute, uia istoria erota pio aphrisuene kai spartariste ki apo anapsuktiko ue anthrakiko, ua kai karpos perisulloges guro apo uia trouere praguatikoteta: te uakhe pou dinoun katheuerina oi paranouoi uetanastes, oi apolutoi tukhodioktes tou eikostou protou aiona."◊
‘E Merikat Mplakgount zei me ten adelphe tes Konstans kai ton theio tous Tzoulian se ena apomonomeno spiti. To mono pou thelei einai na diateresei ton euthrausto tropo zoes tous. Apo tote omos pou e Konstans athootheke gia te dolophonia tes upoloipes oikogeneias tous, o kosmos den aphenei se esukhia tous Mplakgount. Otan o xaderphos Tsarl tous episkeptetai me exairetika philike diathese kai epimenei na dei tous titlous idioktesias tou spitiou tous, e Merikat tha kanei o,ti pernaei apo to kheri tes gia na prostatepsei ten enapomeinasa oikogeneia tes.
"To Zousame panta s' ena kastroeinai mia mageutike istoria pou anastatonei, mia istoria me entase pou karadokei diarkos, opos tis stigmes prin apo to xespasma kataigidas. E Jackson uphainei tis lexeis tes opos e Merikat ta phulakta pou pisteuei oti tha prostatepsoun ten oikogeneia tes apo ton exo kosmo. E agonia kai e entase klimakonontai pros ena telos pou einai sunama anapopheukto kai anapantekho.
Ena meros tou eautou mou den thelei na moirastei auto to biblio me allous - einai ena prosopiko pathos, ena mustiko xorki maures mageias. Ostoso, elpizo pos oi neoi anagnostes mporei na niosoun opos eniosa ki ego otan to protoanakalupsa, mia ereme ekplexe: nai, uparkhoun toso dunata biblia* nai, e graphe mporei na einai toso anatrikhiastike. Zeleuo osous tha to diabasoun prote phora kai tha anakalupsoun ste sunekheia to sunolo tou ergou tes Shirley Jackson - tromaktiko, agrieutiko, aploustata paradoxo."
(David Barnett, Guardian)"ÿ
’In this sequel to The Storm Whale, the boy, Noi, is caught in a storm at sea and his whale friend comes to his rescue.
When Noi's dad sails out on one last fishing trip before winter, Noi waits for him at home. But as the storm worsens and his dad does not return, Noi decides to go looking for his dad. But the storm is powerful and dangerous, and soon Noi, too, is stuck in the icy sea. When it seems that all hope is lost, a friend comes to help Noi and his father. Poignant and evocative, this is a beautiful celebration of friendship and family, and the special bond between a father and son."›
⁄To biblio auto -opos alloste kai e omonume teleoptike ekpompe sten opoia basisteke- den apeuthunetai monakha stous latreis tes logotekhnias alla se ena polu eurutero koino, to opoio paramenei euaistheto sta problemata kai stis anazeteseis tou kairou mas. Metagraphontas tis suzeteseis pou ekane eite monos eite me te Mikela Khartoulare me tous 33 diasemous suggrapheis autou tou tomou, o Antaios Khrusostomides strephei kathe phora te matia tou se ena sugkekrimeno thema analoga me ta endiapheronta tou sunomilete tou. Themata pou aphoroun ten epokhe mas -ta problemata tes demokratias ston dutiko kosmo, o threskeutikos phanatismos, to problema ton ethnikismon, e krise ethikon axion, o ratsismos, ta europaika istorika traumata, e sexoualike eleutheria- diastauronontai sunekhos me themata pou aphoroun te logotekhnia, to mellon tes, te thetike e merikes phores arnetike epidrase tes sten koinonia. Mia peridiabase se enan kosmo magiko grammene skhedon san muthistorema.
Nikolo Amaniti - Margkaret Atgount - Moris Attia - Martin Balzer - Mario Bargkas Liosa (Nompel 2010) - Gkamal Al Gitani - Nantin Gkorntimer (Nompel 1991) - Khans Magknous Entsesmpergker - Khabier Therkas - Antrea Kamileri - Ntaniel Kelman - Khaniph Kioureisi - Tzon Le Kare - Klaountio Magkris - Blantimir Makanin - Ian MakGiouan - Norman Manea - Khari Moulis - Tzon Mpanbil - Amos Oz - Pol Oster - Orkhan Pamouk (Nompel 2006) - Tzortz Pelekanos - Serkhio Pitol - Santiago Ronkaliolo - Zoze Saramagkou (Nompel 1998) - Ingko Soultse - Antonio Tampouki - P. Nt. Tzeims - Ntario Pho (Nompel 1997) - Karlos Phouentes - Giasmina Khantra - Alan Kholingkkherst"‡
›<>Noiotho oti apodunamonomai, klerike. Aphese tis prokatalepseis sou, gine antras, gine anthropinos, dikhos phobo kai prosdokia* aphese exo tous theous kai tis threskeies sou: ola auta einai gia na oplizoun to kheri ton anthropon* kai mono sto onoma auton ton phrikaleoteton khutheke perissotero aima ste ge apo olous tous allous polemous kai tis mastiges mazi. Aparnesou ten idea enos allou kosmou, den uparkhei* men aparnetheis omos ten apolause tes eutukhias kai ten ulopoiese tes. Autos einai o monos tropos pou sou prospherei e phuse gia na zeugaroseis ten uparxe sou e na ten exaploseis... Phile mou, e edone uperxe pantote to polutimotero agatho mou* se ole mou te zoe tes anaba kanteli, tora thelo ego na sbeso sta kheria tes...>>
Enas ieromenos prospathei mataia na sosei ten psukhe enos etoimothanatou ten eskhate stigme. Enas suntomos paigniodes dialogos pou perikleiei tis kentrikes apopseis gia te zoe, te threskeia kai tis edones tou <>Markesiou, tou <>, kata ton Apollinair."Â
‚Ena egkataleimmeno paidi...
Tis paramones tou A Pagkosmiou Polemou ena koritsaki, e Nel, brisketai egkataleimmeno s' ena ploio gia ten Australia. Mia musteriodes gunaika, e suggrapheas, pou uposkhetheke na ten prosekhei, exaphanisteke khoris n' aphesei ikhne.
Ena tromero mustiko...
To bradu ton genethlion tes, otan ekleise ta eikosi ena, e Nel mathainei ena mustiko pou th' allaxei te zoe tes gia panta. Polu argotera, xekinaei ena taxidi gia na brei ten aletheia, pou ten odegei stis anemodarmenes aktes tes Kornouales kai s' ena arkhontiko pou aneke kapote sten aristokratike oikogeneia Maountraset.
Mia musteriodes kleronomia...
Otan pethainei e Nel, e eggone tes e Kassandra dekhetai mia aprosdokete kleronomia. To Kliph Kotatz ki o xekhasmenos tou kepos einai periboeta stous ntopious tes Kornouales gia ta mustika pou kruboun. Mustika gia ten kataramene oikogeneia Maountraset kai ten prostateuomene tous Elaiza, mia suggraphea skoteinon biktorianon paramuthion. Ekei e Kassandra th' anakalupsei telika ten aletheia gia ten oikogeneia Maountraset kai tha lusei to palio mustiko enos mikrou egkataleimmenou paidiou."Ê
„Se mia mikre pole tes dutikes Nigerias tessera neara adelphia -o mikroteros einai ennia kai o megaluteros dekapente- ekmetalleuontai ten apousia tou patera tous apo to spiti gia na pane gia psarema sto apagoreumeno kontino potami. Ekei tha sunantesoun enan epikinduno trelo pou tha propheteusei oti o megaluteros adelphos tha dolophonethei apo ena apo ta adelphia tou. Aute e propheteia tha stathei e aphorme na dialuthei o iskhuros desmos tous kai e apheteria mias alusidas tragikon gegonoton skhedon muthikon diastaseon.
Mia istoria agapes, misous kai ekdikeses pou diadramatizetai me phonto tis koinonikopolitikes exelixeis ste Nigeria tes dekaetias tou '90. Mia sugklonistike aphegese me te phone tou mikroterou adelphou, tou Mpentzamin, kai exairetike khrese tes glossas. Anaphores sten aphrikanike phuse, stous muthous kai tis doxasies tes Nigerias, katagraphe tes kathemerinotetas me kurio axona te sugkrouse metaxu paradosiakou kai dutikou tropou zoes, se ena exokho proto biblio enos logotekhne pou axiopoiei me monterno tropo ten aphrikanike aphegematike paradose kai phainetai na ekhei makra kariera mprosta tou."Ë
ÂDuo idanikoi erastes psakhnoun o enas ton allo khoris oute oi idioi na to suneidetopoioun, se enan kosmo pou allazei, se ena khrono reusto, aprosdioristo.
Alla tous odegei e agonia, e mania tes sunanteses.
E Aomame kai o Tengko zoun parallela, diaskhizontas ton topo kai to khrono, badizontas anapoda se emerologia kai khartes kai riskarontas ta panta mesa sto akros poietiko kai epikinduno sumpan tou Mourakami.
Mustikes adelphotetes, sektes, phauloi exousiastes, adistaktoi dolophonoi, ekdiketes, maures magikes istories, protognores diodoi, apokaluptikes rogmes, mia khrusallida sta sunnepha, psukhedeleia kai paradose, stoikheiomenes mousikes, nostalgia, mia matia sto pheggari - e sta pheggaria.
Sta duo pheggaria tou 1Q84, autes tes Poles ton gaton.
To polusuzetemeno magnum opus tou Mourakami sunista ena protophanes aphegematiko xephantoma, ena paneguri lexeon, eikonon, aistheseon kai, otan teleionei e phantasmagoria, auto pou menei den einai para mia aploustate -kai gi' auto asullepta sunarpastike- istoria agapes, ena erotiko paramuthi pou sunopsizetai sto aphoplistiko, paraphoro, lutrotiko kratema ton kherion."Ï
ÈTo "Animal" isos sas thumisei ena apo ta biblia tes Agkatha Kristi. E kai polla mazi. Mila gia kleronomous sto anoigma mias diathekes, kleronomous pou misoun o enas ton allo, kai pou anamesa tous brisketai mia athoa, aponereute parateretria: e Mpeatris Phragkonar.
Ki akome mila gia mia khionothuella, pou apokleiei olous autous tous anthropous sto idio spiti. To kako phusika den argei na sumbei. Enas-enas oi kalesmenoi arkhizoun na apodemoun. Ta ptomata auxanontai, oi upoptoi ligosteuoun. Omos anamesa tous uparkhei ki ena allo kako, aorato. E eroida einai e mone pou isos mporei na anakalupsei ton enokho. Eseis;"Ù
ÒEnas allos titlos tou muthistorematos tou Petrou Markare tha mporouse na einai O astunomos Kharitos sten Pole. O Kharitos kai e Adriane apophasizoun na egkataleipsoun gia ligo ten Athena kai na pane ekdrome sten Konstantinoupole. Thaumazoun ta axiotheata kai ten politike kouzina alla, opos sumbainei skhedon panta me ton astunomo Kharito, e khara tou de diarkei polu. Mia elikiomene gunaika apo ton Ponto, pou zei ste Drama, epistrephei meta apo khronia sta patria edaphe kai arkhizei na skotonei. O Kharitos prepei na prolabei ton epomeno phono tes, alla kai na katapherei na sunergastei me enan Tourko astunomiko, ton Mourat, me ton opoio tous "sundeei" mia amoibaia kakhupopsia. E Konstantinoupole tou Petrou Markare mesa apo ta matia tou astunomou Kharitou. Ena sunarpastiko muthistorema gemato pikria, sarkasmo kai nostalgia. Gia prote phora o Kharitos makria apo ten Athena."Ù	
Ò	Oslo, 1969. Otan o Magkntalon Selnteroup, poluekatommurioukhos kai proen melos tes Antistases, soriazetai nekros kata te diarkeia enos souare, o epitheoretes Kolmpiorn Kristiansen, gnostos kai os K2, menei anaudos. O logos; To thuma eikhe epikoinonesei mazi tou molis ten proegoumene mera ekphrazontas phobous gia te zoe tou.
Suntoma, ginetai olophanero oti kai oi deka kalesmenoi sto deipno tou Selnteroup mporoun na theorethoun upoptoi. Polloi apo tous oikeious tou eklipontos ton apekhthanontan e ton misousan? e de prosphate diatheke tou isos purodotesei polles kai sobares antidraseis. Omos poios apo tous kalesmenous -apo ten proen kai te nun suzugo kai ta tria paidia tou eos te goeteutike grammatea kai tous palious suntrophous tou sten Antistase- eikhe to iskhurotero kinetro gia phono;
Me ten anektimete boetheia tes Patrisia -mias euphuestates, phlegmatikes neares gunaikas, pou zei mia periorismene kat' oikon zoe sten anaperike karekla tes-, o K2 arkhizei na xemplekei ton isto ton psematon se kathemia apo tis katatheseis ton kalesmenon. Kathos, omos, e astunomia lambanei to ena musteriodes gramma meta to allo, me proeidopoieseis gia thanatous pou epontai, o K2 suneidetopoiei oti prepei na apoduthei se agona dromou gia na xeskepasei ton dolophono."˙
˜Na photizeis ta sobarotera problemata kai tautokhrona na me grapheis oute mia sobare phrase, na goeteuesai apo ten pragmatikoteta tou semerinou kosmou kai tautokhrona na apopheugeis kathe realismo, auto einai e "Giorte tes asemantotetas". Opoios gnorizei ta proegoumena biblia tou Kountera xerei oti den einai diolou aprosdokete e sunetheia tou na ensomatonei s' ena muthistorema ena "asobaro" kommati. Se arketa kephalaia tes "Athanasias" o Gkaite me ton Khemingouei perpatoun mazi, phluaroun kai diaskedazoun. Kai ste "Braduteta" e Bera, e gunaika tou suggraphea, leei ston antra tes: "Sukhna mou eleges pos thes na grapseis kapote ena muthistorema opou kamia lexe den tha einai sobare... se proeidopoio: phulaxou: karadokoun oi ekhthroi sou". Omos o Kountera, anti na phulakhtei, pragmatopoiei epitelous sto akeraio to palio aisthetiko orama tou, s' auto to muthistorema pou mporei kaneis na to dei kai san thaumaste sunopse oloklerou tou ergou tou. Paraxene sunopse. Paraxenos epilogos. Paraxeno gelio, pou to empneei e epokhe mas, pou einai komike epeide ekhase kathe aisthese tou khioumor. Ti allo mporei na pei kaneis; Tipota. Diabaste!"˙
˜E Astunomia khreiazetai ton Khari Khole giati enas dolophonos trigurna stous dromous tou Oslo kai dolophonei astunomikous. Sugkekrimena ta thumata briskontai se topous egklematon pou den katapheran na exikhniasoun. Oi phonoi einai biaioi kai e antidrase ton MME usterike. O aionios Khari, ntetektib apo te phuse tou, ekhei emplakei se oles tis semantikes ereunes egklematon ton teleutaion khronon sto Oslo. Me ten polu prosopike tou aisthese dikaiosunes na ton kathodegei, pistos se o,ti agapa kai apophasismenos na to uperaspistei, aute te phora moiazei khamenos kai anemporos. Arage tha ta katapherei na xeperasei gia alle mia phora ton eauto tou kathos to nauagio tes prosopikes tou zoes ton ekhei buthisei ston pato.
KRITIKES
O Nesbo kataphere na demiourgesei mia poluepipede istoria pou tha sas parei to mualo. To pos koruphonei to saspens tha didasketai sto mellon se seminaria demiourgikes graphes... Adeiaste to programma sas, kathiste anapautika kai apolauste oles tis anatropes kai tis ekplexeis pou sas epiphulassei o basilias tes sugkhrones astunomikes logotekhnias.
Sunday Express
Den uparkhoun pio sunarpastika, pio entona kai pio skoteina astunomika thriler ste skandinabike skhole astunomikes logotekhnias apo ta biblia tes seiras Khari Khole. E dekate peripeteia tou Khole einai to kalutero biblio tes seiras mekhri semera.
Sunday Mirror
Ethistiko... Sto stil tou sirial Breaking Bad.
Chicago Tribune
Diaphthora, narkotika, sophronistike politike kai "anorthodoxes" methodoi tes astunomias mplekontai me akraies sumperiphores se ena biblio tou opoiou e anagnose moiazei me bolta me to trenaki tou tromou. Sou kobei ten anasa.
Boston Globe"¸
˘O nearos poietes Agathonas kerdise to brabeio sta Lenaia to etos 416 p.Kh., epi arkhontos Euphemou (Athen. 217a). Ten epomene mera omos kalese se sumposio olous tous exekhontes andres tes aristokratikes taxes tes Athenas, epeide ten proegoumene mera den eikhan mporesei na pareurethoun sten giorte. Sto sumposio peran meros o Aristodemos, o Phaidros, o Agathonas, o giatros Eruximakhos, o Pausanias, o Aristophanes, o Alkibiades kai argotera o Sokrates, o opoios arkhika distaze na pareurethei kai perimene exo apo ten porta akougontas ta legomena. E prote mas epaphe me ton Sokrate ginetai sto endiameso tou keimenou, te stigme pou autos emphanizetai sto sumposio. Oi pareuriskomenoi apophasizoun na perasoun te bradia okhi me agrio phagopoti, alla omorpha kai dialektika, suzetontas guro apo ena sugkekrimeno thema. To thema tou sumposiou einai loipon e anazetese tes uphes tou erota: <>"¸
˘Anthropoi tes nukhtas, tou perithoriou. Enas tromponistas tzaz, e idioktetria enos <>xenodokheiou, mia Kineza porne pou ten ekhei spasei sto xulo kapoio stelekhos etaireias. Duo adelphes, e Eri, ena montelo pou o lethargos tou tautizetai me lethe, kai e Mari, mia phoitetria pou tha sunantesei ton stoikheiomeno thiaso tis mikres ores. Oi duo adelphes kai oi planodioi tou mesonuktiou, para ten abusso pou tous khorizei, sundeontai me mustika kai anagkes pou tha apodeikhtoun iskhurotera apo katheti. Suntoma katalabainoume oti e Eri, buthismene se enan aphusiko upno, eite tha xupnesei xanagennemene, eite tha khathei. To muthistorema auto tou Mourakami einai mia aphegese pou se upnotizei kai, tautokhrona, mia diaphoretike anagnose. Zeta ten isorropia anamesa ston eauto kai ton Allo, anamesa sten autosuneidese kai ten allelokatanoese, te skepse, te sumpatheia kai ten agape. To khioumor, e oxunoia kai e gnoste dioratikoteta tou megalou Iapona suggraphea smigoun me mia pneumatikoteta spania kai me ena logo diakritiko peri ethous, kai dinoun akoma ena aristourgema, suntomo, akros idiaitero kai, os sunethos, apolaustiko. Pege: www.lifo.gr"˝
˙Ti sumbainei otan e metroteta den einai mia oneiremene empeiria;
Pos niothei mia metera apenanti ston gio tes ton dolophono;
Poies einai oi euthunes tes;
Egklematias genniesai e ginesai;
E Iba pote den ethele pragmatika na ginei metera. Sigoura den ethele na ginei e metera enos psukhrou agoriou pou dolophonese ephta summathetes tou, enan upallelo tes skholikes kantinas kai mia demophile kathegetria tou liges meres prin kleisei ta dekaxi.
Duo khronia meta ta tragika gegonota, erthe e ora e Iba na analusei me eilikrineia ton gamo, ten kariera tes, ten oikogeneia tes, te skhese tes me ta paidia tes, to phoniko xespasma tou Kebin se mia seira apo aphoplistika exomologetikes epistoles pou apeuthunontai ston khameno suzugo tes, ton Phranklin.
Aphupnistiko kai prokletiko, to muthistorema auto agapetheke apo ekatommuria anagnostes se oloklero ton kosmo kai prokalese thuella suzeteseon."Ä
˝O kurios Pernti einai "logotekhnikos pharmakopoios". Sto ploto bibliopoleio tou, stis okhthes tou Sekouana, suntagographei muthistoremata gia kathe duskolia tes zoes -proteinei stous pelates tou biblia pou tha giatrepsoun tis psukhes tous.
Ton mono pou den mporei na giatrepsei einai ton eauto tou aphou exakolouthei na ton stoikheionei to phantasma tes megales tou agapes pou exaphanisteke prin apo eikosi ena khronia, aphenontas piso tes mono ena gramma. Ena gramma pou ekeinos den anoixe pote.
Auto to kalokairi o kurios Pernti mpainei epitelous ston peirasmo na diabasei to gramma -kai tote ta panta allazoun.
Sekonei agkura kai pheugei gia ton noto tes Gallias. Me suntaxidiotes enan diasemo suggraphea pou ekhei khasei ten empneuse tou ki enan erotokhtupemeno seph, tha kanei ena taxidi sten kardia tes Probegkias. Ena taxidi piso stis anamneseis, ki apo ekei xana ste zoe...
E Nina Gkeorgke me sageneutike graphe mas dinei mia glukia kai sugkhronos diaskedastike istoria gemate euaisthesia, pou tha sas sunarpasei."␀␀`@"␀␀p@"	
